## Development Commands
### Core Development
- `pnpm dev` - Start Expo development server (port 8081)
- `pnpm web` - Start Expo Web development server
- `pnpm ios` - Run iOS app (includes Xcode version check)
- `pnpm android` - Run Android app
- `pnpm web:build` - Build web app for production
- `pnpm prebuild` - Generate native code before builds

### Platform-Specific Development
- `pnpm start:dev-client` - Start with dev client
- `pnpm web:serve` - Serve built web app
- `pnpm adb:reverse` - Reverse Android port forwarding

## Code Quality Commands
### Fast Iteration (Affected Packages Only)
- `pnpm check:affected` - Lint and type check affected packages (Nx affected)
- `pnpm lint:affected` - Lint affected packages only (Nx affected)
- `pnpm typecheck:affected` - Type check affected packages only (Nx affected)

### Comprehensive Validation (All Packages)
- `pnpm check` - Lint and type check all packages (Nx run-many)
- `pnpm build` - Build all packages (Nx run-many)
- `pnpm format:fix` - Fix formatting with Biome (Nx format:write)
- `pnpm lint:fix` - Fix linting issues (Nx run-many)
- `pnpm typecheck` - TypeScript type checking (Nx run-many)

### Nx-Specific Commands
- `pnpm graph` - Visualize project dependency graph
- `pnpm nx:reset` - Clear Nx cache
- `pnpm affected:build` - Build only affected projects
- `pnpm affected:test` - Test only affected projects
- `pnpm affected:lint` - Lint only affected projects
- `pnpm affected:typecheck` - Typecheck only affected projects

### Nx Direct Commands
- `nx run core:test` - Run tests for specific project
- `nx run-many -t build` - Run build for all projects
- `nx affected -t test` - Run tests for affected projects
- `nx graph` - Open interactive project graph
- `nx show projects` - List all projects
- `nx show project core` - Show project configuration

### Comprehensive Testing
- `pnpm test:all` - Full test suite (integration + build)
- `pnpm test:build` - Build verification
- `pnpm test:lint` - Lint and type check
- `pnpm test:deps` - Dependency checks
- `pnpm test:integration` - Integration testing
- `pnpm test:performance` - Performance testing
- `pnpm test:deno:types` - Deno type checking for Edge Functions

## Supabase Commands
### Core Operations
- `pnpm supa start` - Start local Supabase
- `pnpm supa stop` - Stop local Supabase
- `pnpm supa status` - Check Supabase status
- `pnpm supa db reset` - Reset database (use with caution)

### Type Generation
- `pnpm supa:generate` - Generate types from local DB
- `pnpm supa:generate:remote` - Generate types from remote DB

### Development Tools
- `pnpm supa:studio` - Open Supabase Studio (http://127.0.0.1:54323)
- `pnpm supa:mailpit` - Open Mailpit (http://127.0.0.1:54324)

### Migration Management
- `pnpm supa migration:new <name>` - Create new migration
- `pnpm supa migration:up` - Apply migrations

